  + Found by #1227 (Day 267 21:35). #1227 flags `$PWD`, `${PWD}`, `$(pwd)`, `` `pwd` ``, `./` and every one-component absolute path (`/home`, `/data`), but `analyze_bash_command(command)` in src/safety.rs takes only the command text, so a two-or-more-component absolute path that happens to be the cwd cannot be told apart from any other folder. Claude Code 2.1.330 asks for this case.
    
